msgid "value must be zero or a positive number"
msgstr "值必须为零或正数"

#: src/presentation.rs:53
msgid "value must be a non-negative whole number"
msgstr "值必须是非负整数"

#. TRANSLATORS: {choices} lists the allowed values, such as "cpu, cuda".
#: src/presentation.rs:56
#, python-brace-format
msgid "value must be one of {choices}"
msgstr "值必须是以下之一：{choices}"

#: src/presentation.rs:59
msgid "this value cannot be edited"
msgstr "此值无法编辑"

#: src/presentation.rs:158
msgid "Which version of this model to run."
msgstr "要运行此模型的哪个版本。"

#: src/presentation.rs:165
msgid "The inference engine this model runs on."
msgstr "此模型使用的推理引擎。"

#: src/presentation.rs:171
msgid "Streaming output"
msgstr "流式输出"

#: src/presentation.rs:172
msgid "Emit partial transcription results while speech is being processed."
msgstr "在语音处理过程中发送部分转写结果。"

#: src/presentation.rs:179
msgid ""
"Unload the inference service after this many idle seconds; zero disables the"
" delay."
msgstr "推理服务空闲这么多秒后卸载；设为 0 可禁用延迟卸载。"

#: src/presentation.rs:185
msgid "Verbose logging"
msgstr "详细日志"

#: src/presentation.rs:186
msgid "Write additional diagnostics to the system log."
msgstr "将额外的诊断信息写入系统日志。"

#: src/presentation.rs:192
msgid "Socket path"
msgstr "套接字路径"

#: src/presentation.rs:193
msgid "Raw Unix socket path used by the transcription service."
msgstr "转写服务使用的原始 Unix 套接字路径。"

#: src/presentation.rs:199
msgid "Minimum speech before pause commit (seconds)"
msgstr "停顿提交前的最短语音时长（秒）"

#: src/presentation.rs:200
msgid "Speech required before a pause can commit a transcript chunk."
msgstr "停顿能够提交一段转写内容所需的最短语音时长。"

#: src/presentation.rs:205
msgid "Pause length for commit (seconds)"
msgstr "提交停顿时长（秒）"

#: src/presentation.rs:206
msgid "Silence duration that commits the current transcript chunk."
msgstr "提交当前转写片段所需的静音时长。"

#: src/presentation.rs:211
msgid "Maximum uncommitted audio (seconds)"
msgstr "最大未提交音频时长（秒）"

#: src/presentation.rs:212
msgid "Maximum speech window retained before a transcript chunk is forced to commit."
msgstr "强制提交一段转写内容前保留的最长语音窗口。"

#: src/presentation.rs:217
msgid "Partial result interval (seconds)"
msgstr "部分结果间隔（秒）"

#: src/presentation.rs:218
msgid "Interval between unstable partial results; zero disables partial results."
msgstr "不稳定部分结果之间的间隔；设为 0 可禁用部分结果。"

#: src/presentation.rs:223
msgid "Partial result audio window (seconds)"
msgstr "部分结果音频窗口（秒）"

#: src/presentation.rs:224
msgid ""
"Recent uncommitted audio used for partial results; zero uses the whole "
"window."
msgstr "用于部分结果的近期未提交音频；设为 0 表示使用整个窗口。"

#: src/presentation.rs:229
msgid "Compute type"
msgstr "计算类型"

#: src/presentation.rs:230
msgid ""
"Runtime numeric format override. Leave the model's own value unchanged "
"unless required."
msgstr "运行时数值格式覆盖。除非确有需要，否则请保留模型自身的值。"

#: src/presentation.rs:236
msgid "Attention context size"
msgstr "注意力上下文大小"

#: src/presentation.rs:237
msgid "Model-specific latency and accuracy context. Empty uses the engine default."
msgstr "特定于模型的延迟和准确率上下文。留空则使用引擎默认值。"

#: src/presentation.rs:296
msgid "This model provides no description for this setting."
msgstr "此模型未提供该设置的说明。"

#. TRANSLATORS: {percent} is how much of the download has arrived, a number from 0
#. to 100.
#: src/ui/install_control.rs:131
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Installing {percent}%"
msgstr "正在安装 {percent}%"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:41
msgid "Sounds on start, stop and error"
msgstr "开始、停止和出错时播放声音"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:42
msgid ""
"Play a short sound when dictation starts listening, when it stops, and when "
"it fails."
msgstr "听写开始监听、停止以及失败时播放短音。"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:50
msgid "Sound style"
msgstr "声音样式"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:51
msgid ""
"Which sounds play: Chime is a struck bar, Bird whistled chirps, Voice the "
"hums people make while listening, Marimba a rising fifth, Water falling "
"drops, Radio a walkie-talkie and Strings a plucked koto."
msgstr "选择播放的声音：铃声是敲击声，鸟鸣是鸟叫声，人声是聆听时发出的哼声，马林巴琴是上行五度，水滴是滴水声，无线电是对讲机声，拨弦是古筝拨弦声。"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:60
msgid "When to transcribe"
msgstr "何时转写"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:61
msgid ""
"As you speak shows partial text in the field while you talk; When you stop "
"injects the whole transcript once the utterance ends."
msgstr "“边说边转写”会在说话时把部分文本显示在输入框中；“停止后转写”会在本次听写结束后一次性输入完整转写内容。"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:69
msgid "Spoken language"
msgstr "口语语言"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:70
msgid ""
"A BCP-47-ish code (en, fr, zh) for the language you dictate in. The model "
"skips language detection and decodes in this language; a code that does not "
"match what is spoken degrades the transcript. Empty lets the model decide."
msgstr ""
"用于指定听写语言的 BCP-47 风格代码（如 "
"en、fr、zh）。模型会跳过语言检测，并按此语言解码；代码与实际所说语言不符会降低转写质量。留空则由模型自行判断。"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:80
msgid "Indicator style"
msgstr "指示器样式"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:81
msgid ""
"All three render the same calibrated audio envelope: Default is a level bar "
"in the accent colour, Ribbon a flowing GPU wave, VU meter a segmented meter."
msgstr "三种样式都显示经过校准的同一音频包络：默认样式是强调色的电平条，彩带是流动的 GPU 波形，电平表是分段式电平表。"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:91
msgid "Stop after silence (seconds)"
msgstr "静音后停止（秒）"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:92
msgid ""
"With tap-to-start activation, end the dictation session on its own after "
"this many seconds without speech. 0 keeps it running until the next tap. "
"Hold-to-talk always ends with the key."
msgstr "使用点按启动时，在没有语音的这么多秒后自动结束听写。设为 0 会一直运行到下一次点按。按住说话模式始终在松开按键时结束。"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:101
msgid "Vocabulary"
msgstr "词汇"

#: ../data/glib-2.0/schemas/com.canonical.Myna.Dictation.gschema.xml:102
msgid ""
"Names and terms the model should prefer when it is unsure, such as "
"\"Siobhan\" or \"PipeWire\". Up to 100 words or short phrases."
msgstr "模型不确定时应优先采用的名称和术语，例如“Siobhan”或“PipeWire”。最多 100 个词或短语。"

#: data/com.canonical.Myna.Config.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "Set up and configure local dictation"
msgstr "设置并配置本地听写"

#: data/com.canonical.Myna.Config.metainfo.xml:14
msgid ""
"Myna turns speech into text on your computer, with no audio or text leaving "
"it. Myna Settings guides you through installing it and a speech model, then "
"configures dictation and its speech models."
msgstr "Myna 会在您的电脑上将语音转换为文本，音频和文本都不会离开本机。Myna 设置会引导您安装 Myna 和语音模型，然后配置听写及其语音模型。"

#: data/com.canonical.Myna.Config.desktop:4
msgid "Dictation Settings"
msgstr "听写设置"

#: data/com.canonical.Myna.Config.desktop:5
msgid "Configure Myna dictation and its speech models"
msgstr "配置 Myna 听写及其语音模型"

#. TRANSLATORS: Search terms for this application. Keep every semicolon, including
#. the last.
#: data/com.canonical.Myna.Config.desktop:12
msgid "dictation;speech;transcription;voice;model;"
msgstr "听写;语音;转写;声音;模型;"
